[02:12.86]Okay, step one, listen first, don't write anything.|第一步，先听，什么都别写。
[02:16.02]Step two, listen and write the keywords.|第二步，边听边写关键词。
[02:19.42]Step three, listen again and add more words as much as you can get.|第三步，再听一遍，尽量补上更多词。
[02:23.68]Step four, listen again and write as much as you can.|第四步，再听，尽可能多写。
[02:26.64]Step five, check the script.|第五步，对照原文。
[02:29.36]Step six, repeat until you have no mistakes.|第六步，重复到没有错误为止。
[02:32.86]Don't worry about the mistakes.|别担心出错。
[02:34.24]Mistakes are part of this process.|出错是这个过程的一部分。
