[02:53.82]Don't pause.|不要暂停，
[02:55.00]Don't look up words.|不要查词，
[02:56.72]Don't take notes.|不要记笔记。
[02:57.86]Just listen.|就听。
[02:59.68]Train your brain to follow meaning as much as you can.|尽量训练大脑跟着意思走。
[03:02.60]Three, choose content you actually enjoy.|第三，选你真正喜欢的内容。
